-- הסכם קיבוצי — הפחתה בדמי ההבראה במהלך שנת 2011 חלף שנת 2010 (7.6.2010):
-- the same parties put the havraa reduction the agreement of 16.6.2009 set
-- for 2010 off to 2011, and pay back what was already taken in 2010. It
-- amends that agreement's §§4.2, 4.3, 4.4, 4.6 and 4.7 (§4), and keeps the
-- rest (§5). Encoded as an amendment: it imports the 2009 agreement's module
-- (l4/agreements/framework/2009-06-16_framework-agreement_public-sector_havraa-reduction.l4)
-- and states what it changes, from the day it was signed.
--
-- §4(ג) amends §4.4 "as amended by the follow-up committee's decision of
-- 19.7.2009", which the corpus does not hold: what that decision made §4.4
-- say is outside the corpus, and where the new text leans on it ("the time
-- for which no havraa pay was to be paid at all"), it is a fact of the case.
-- Like the 2009 agreement, it speaks to no pay item of the shared vocabulary
-- and is not one of the agreements' root's instruments.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT parties
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT budget_foundations_law
IMPORT `2009-06-16_framework-agreement_public-sector_havraa-reduction`

§ `הסכם קיבוצי — הפחתה בדמי ההבראה במהלך שנת 2011 חלף שנת 2010 (7.6.2010)`

-- akn:preamble The agreement's frame: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:preamble/p1 The registration stamp (16.8.2010); no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p2 The document's title; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p3 The date of signing; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p4 "Between"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p5 The State and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p6 The Centre of Local Government, for every local authority save the three large cities; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p7 The three large cities and who represents them; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p8 The Centre of Regional Councils; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p9 The Union of Religious Councils; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p10 The National Insurance Institute; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p11 The Employment Service; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p12 The institutions of higher education; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p13 The Hadassah Medical Organisation; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p14 Clalit Health Services; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p15 The Airports Authority; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p16 Israel Post; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p17 The fire-service associations of towns; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p18 The employers' short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p19 "On the one side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p20 "And"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p21 The Histadrut and who represents it; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p22 The Histadrut's short name; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p23 "On the other side"; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p24 A recital: the agreement of 16.6.2009 reduced the havraa pay of 2009 and 2010, and is named here "the agreement for partial payment of havraa pay".
-- akn:preamble/p25 A recital: the havraa statute was published on 23.6.2009, and is named here "the law for partial payment of havraa pay".
-- akn:preamble/p26 A recital: the follow-up committee's decision of 19.7.2009 changed §4.4 and set provisions on §4.9.
-- akn:preamble/p27 A recital: the statute's §3 lets an approved agreement carry the reduction past 31.12.2010.
-- akn:preamble/p28 A recital: no reduction in 2010 (what was taken is paid back), and one in 2011 instead.
-- akn:preamble/p29 The words of agreement that introduce the clauses; no rule.

§§ `1 מבוא והוראות כלליות`

@ref akn:art_1 akn:art_1/p1
`the preamble is part of the 2010 deferral` MEANS TRUE

§§ `2 תחולה`

-- (א): as the 2009 agreement's (א); (ב): the Histadrut agrees that it apply
-- also to employees paid by collective agreements and represented by it,
-- of another public employer that joins; the four kinds of public employer
-- are the 2009 agreement's, word for word, and are stated here again
-- because this agreement states them again.
@ref akn:art_2__para_b/p2 akn:art_2__para_b__subpara_1 akn:art_2__para_b__subpara_2 akn:art_2__para_b__subpara_3 akn:art_2__para_b__subpara_4
GIVEN e IS A `havraa agreement employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `employed by a public employer in the 2010 sense` e IF
        `is a budgeted body` (e's `the employing body`)
    OR e's `employed by a health corporation`
    OR `is a supported body` (e's `the employing body`)
    OR e's `employed by a funded education institution`

@ref akn:art_2 akn:art_2__para_a akn:art_2__para_b
GIVEN e IS A `havraa agreement employee`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the 2010 deferral applies to` e IF
        e's `paid by agreements of a scale the Histadrut represents`
    AND (    e's `employed by an employer that signed the 2009 havraa agreement`
         OR (    `employed by a public employer in the 2010 sense` e
             AND e's `the employer joined the 2009 havraa agreement`))

§§ `3 הסכם לתקופה מסוימת`

-- From the day it was signed to 31 December 2011, in force from signing;
-- nothing in it, §4 included, renews itself.
@ref akn:art_3 akn:art_3/p1 akn:art_3/p2
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in the 2010 deferral's period` d IF
        d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 7 6 2010)
    AND d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2011)

`the 2010 deferral renews itself` MEANS FALSE

#ASSERT `in the 2010 deferral's period` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2011)
#ASSERT NOT `in the 2010 deferral's period` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 6 2010)

§§ `4 הכנסת שינויים בהסכם לתשלום חלקי של דמי הבראה`

-- The changes made to the 2009 agreement, which stand from this
-- agreement's signing.
@ref akn:art_4 akn:art_4/p1
`the 2009 agreement is amended from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 7 6 2010

-- (א), first paragraph: §4.2 now halves the havraa day of 2011 in place of
-- 2010's, by the same rule (half, no more than the State employees'
-- reduction): the price is the 2009 agreement's own computation.
@ref akn:art_4__para_a
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the havraa day is halved in, as amended in 2010` y IF
    y EQUALS 2009 OR y EQUALS 2011

GIVEN `the havraa day's price` IS A NUMBER
      `the State employees' reduction` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the reduced havraa day price of 2011` `the havraa day's price` `the State employees' reduction` IS
    `the reduced havraa day price` `the havraa day's price` `the State employees' reduction`

#ASSERT `the havraa day is halved in, as amended in 2010` 2011
#ASSERT NOT `the havraa day is halved in, as amended in 2010` 2010
#ASSERT `the reduced havraa day price of 2011` 400 250 EQUALS 200

DECLARE `havraa deferral action` IS ONE OF
    `pay back the part of 2010's havraa pay that was reduced`
    `follow and help carry out the 2010 deferral and decide its disputes`

-- (א), second paragraph: one paid havraa once a year, whose 2010 havraa pay
-- was already paid (reduced) before the June 2010 salary, is paid back the
-- part reduced in 2010 (by the 2009 agreement or the statute) with the July
-- 2010 salary, and no later than the August 2010 salary.
@ref akn:art_4__para_a/p2
GIVEN `the salary month it is paid with` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `2010's reduction is paid back in time` `the salary month it is paid with` IF
    `the salary month it is paid with` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 8 2010)

`paying back 2010's reduction` MEANS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay back the part of 2010's havraa pay that was reduced`

#ASSERT `2010's reduction is paid back in time` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 8 2010)
#ASSERT NOT `2010's reduction is paid back in time` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2010)

-- (ב): in §4.3, "2011" in place of "2010" "in the first line and the
-- third line". The corpus text has no lines; §4.3 holds "2010" twice, both
-- in its second paragraph, and both are replaced (F-framework-havraa-2010-a):
-- where 2009's havraa pay was already paid, none is paid in 2011, save
-- above the State employees' price. The price is the 2009 agreement's
-- computation, unchanged.
@ref akn:art_4__para_b
`the year §4.3 withholds, as amended in 2010` MEANS 2011

`§4(ב) counts lines of §4.3 that its text does not have` MEANS TRUE

#ASSERT `§4(ב) counts lines of §4.3 that its text does not have`

GIVEN `the workplace's havraa day price` IS A NUMBER
      `the State employees' havraa day price` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the havraa day price in 2011 where 2009's was already paid` `the workplace's havraa day price` `the State employees' havraa day price` IS
    `the havraa day price where 2009's was already paid` `the workplace's havraa day price` `the State employees' havraa day price`

#ASSERT `the havraa day price in 2011 where 2009's was already paid` 450 400 EQUALS 50

-- (ג): §4.4, the separate monthly component, as the follow-up committee's
-- decision of 19.7.2009 had amended it (outside the corpus).
@ref akn:art_4__para_c
`why §4.4 as amended on 19.7.2009 is an input` MEANS
    `outside the corpus` "החלטת ועדת המעקב מיום 19.7.2009 בעניין סעיף 4.4 להסכם מיום 16.6.2009"

-- (ג)(1), the new (א)(2), for one employed by the employer in 2009. For
-- 2010: for the time that, as §4.4 stood, no havraa pay was to be paid at
-- all, half the full pay is paid (with the July 2010 salary, no later than
-- August's); for the rest of 2010, what was reduced is paid back; nothing
-- more is reduced in 2010. For 2011: none for 1.7.2011 to 31.12.2011. The
-- share is of the full component a day earns.
@ref akn:art_4__para_c__subpara_1
GIVEN `the day was one §4.4 paid nothing for` IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the share of the havraa component for a day, as amended in 2010, for one employed in 2009` `the day was one §4.4 paid nothing for` d IS
    BRANCH IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2010) AND d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2010)
              THEN IF `the day was one §4.4 paid nothing for` THEN 50% ELSE 1
           IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2011) AND d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2011)
              THEN 0
           OTHERWISE 1

#ASSERT `the share of the havraa component for a day, as amended in 2010, for one employed in 2009` TRUE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2010) EQUALS 50%
#ASSERT `the share of the havraa component for a day, as amended in 2010, for one employed in 2009` FALSE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2010) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the share of the havraa component for a day, as amended in 2010, for one employed in 2009` FALSE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 3 2011) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `the share of the havraa component for a day, as amended in 2010, for one employed in 2009` FALSE (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2011) EQUALS 0

-- (ג)(2), the new (ב), for one not employed by the employer in 2009: none
-- for 1.7.2011 to 31.12.2011; and what was reduced in 2010 is paid back
-- with the July 2010 salary, no later than August's.
@ref akn:art_4__para_c__subpara_2
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the share of the havraa component for a day, as amended in 2010, for one not employed in 2009` d IS
    IF d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2011) AND d `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2011)
    THEN 0
    ELSE 1

-- F-framework-havraa-2010-b: the new (ב) takes the whole second half of
-- 2011 from everyone not employed in 2009, whenever they were hired. For
-- one employed all of 2011 that is half the year, as §4.2 now takes half
-- the annual payment; for one hired on 1.7.2011 or later it is every day of
-- their 2011, where an annual payment is only halved. The 2009 text it
-- replaces scaled the reduction to the time worked ((א)(2), and (ב)'s half).
GIVEN `hired on` IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the share of 2011's havraa component paid to one hired in 2011` `hired on` IS
    IF `hired on` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2011)
    THEN 0
    ELSE (DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2011) MINUS DATE_SERIAL `hired on`)
         DIVIDED BY (DATE_SERIAL (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2012) MINUS DATE_SERIAL `hired on`)

`one hired on 1.9.2011 is paid none of 2011's havraa component, where an annual payment is halved` MEANS
        `the share of 2011's havraa component paid to one hired in 2011` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 9 2011) EQUALS 0
    AND `the share of the havraa component for a day, as amended in 2010, for one not employed in 2009` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 10 2011) EQUALS 0
    AND `the reduced havraa day price of 2011` 400 400 EQUALS 200

#ASSERT `one hired on 1.9.2011 is paid none of 2011's havraa component, where an annual payment is halved`
#ASSERT `the share of 2011's havraa component paid to one hired in 2011` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2011) EQUALS 181 DIVIDED BY 365

-- (ד): in §4.6(א), a havraa year is now one whose havraa pay falls due
-- between the 2009 agreement's entry into force and 31.12.2009, or between
-- 1.1.2011 and 31.12.2011.
@ref akn:art_4__para_d
GIVEN `the date its havraa pay falls due` IS A DATE
      `the 2009 agreement came into force` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `is a havraa year as amended in 2010` `the date its havraa pay falls due` `the 2009 agreement came into force` IF
        (    `the date its havraa pay falls due` `is on or after` `the 2009 agreement came into force`
         AND `the date its havraa pay falls due` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2009))
    OR (    `the date its havraa pay falls due` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2011)
        AND `the date its havraa pay falls due` `is on or before` (DATE_FROM_DMY 31 12 2011))

#ASSERT NOT `is a havraa year as amended in 2010` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2010) (DATE_FROM_DMY 23 6 2009)
#ASSERT `is a havraa year as amended in 2010` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 7 2011) (DATE_FROM_DMY 23 6 2009)

-- (ה): in §4.7's second paragraph, "2011" in place of "2010": a year partly
-- active and partly pensioned, in 2009 or 2011, falls under §4.6.
@ref akn:art_4__para_e
GIVEN y IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a year partly active and partly pensioned falls under 4.6, as amended in 2010, in` y IF
    y EQUALS 2009 OR y EQUALS 2011

#ASSERT NOT `a year partly active and partly pensioned falls under 4.6, as amended in 2010, in` 2010

§§ `5 הסכמים קודמים`

-- Earlier terms stand unless this agreement changes them; the rest of the
-- 2009 agreement stands for this agreement's period.
@ref akn:art_5 akn:art_5/p1 akn:art_5/p2
`earlier terms stand unless the 2010 deferral changes them` MEANS TRUE

`the rest of the 2009 havraa agreement stands` MEANS TRUE

§§ `6 הכרעה בחילוקי דעות`

-- A follow-up committee of the wages commissioner and the chairman of the
-- Histadrut's trade-union department follows and helps carry out the
-- agreement and decides its disputes; its decisions are final.
@ref akn:art_6 akn:art_6/p1 akn:art_6/p2
`following the 2010 deferral` MEANS
    PARTY `the follow-up committee`
    MUST  `follow and help carry out the 2010 deferral and decide its disputes`

`the 2010 follow-up committee's decisions are final` MEANS TRUE

§§ `חתימות ונספח`

-- akn:conclusions The signing formula, the signatures and the employers' captions, a stamp and a fax banner on the signature pages; no rule.
-- akn:attachments The annex: a label row with no text of its own.
-- akn:att_1__hc_1 The joining notice (§2(ב)): its date, addressee, blank fields and copies; no rule beyond §2(ב)'s.
